OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to launch free handyperson
OL,4,Ascheme                                 
OL,6,FA council has launched a free          
OL,7,Fhandyperson service to help residents  
OL,8,Fwith everyday tasks at home.           
OL,10,FAmber Valley Borough Council said the  
OL,11,Fservice, aimed at elderly and disabled 
OL,12,Fpeople, will help residents feel "safer
OL,13,Fand more comfortable" in their own     
OL,14,Fhomes.                                 
OL,16,FThe scheme can help with tasks         
OL,17,Fincluding fitting key safes and grab   
OL,18,Frails, installing stair rails, moving  
OL,19,Ffurniture, putting up curtain poles and
OL,20,Fchanging lightbulbs.                   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
